43
00:08:28.075 --> 00:08:30.411
No, no, no.

44
00:08:30.544 --> 00:08:32.046
-No, stay.

45
00:08:32.179 --> 00:08:34.582
-Get off me.
I've got work to do.

46
00:08:34.715 --> 00:08:36.751
-No, you haven't.

47
00:08:44.258 --> 00:08:46.827
