249
00:30:34.101 --> 00:30:38.540
Maybe a wolf, like a "Red
Riding Hood" type thing.

250
00:30:38.673 --> 00:30:39.674
-It's a man.

251
00:30:39.808 --> 00:30:41.208
-What man?

252
00:30:41.342 --> 00:30:43.778
-A man no one wants to meet.

253
00:30:48.783 --> 00:30:51.452
